C-side: the deck names a bridge signal (nope) the boundary file does not have

load "resistor.osdi"
load "capacitor.osdi"

model vsrc vsource
model r resistor
model c capacitor

v_d2a (nin 0) vsrc type="pwl" file="code:libcosim_bridge.so:vacask_bridge_init:d2a:nope"
r1 (nin nout) r r=1k
c1 (nout 0) c c=100p

control
  analysis tran1 tran step=1n stop=1u
endc
